Dry run 2 jobs, local rehearsal of both job commands before the run request, 27 November 2026
Code: g10-week4-post-training at 4fec31cc plus the 27 November changes in the same pull request as this file.
CPU, Python 3.11.16, torch 2.7.1+cpu. <LAB> lab checkout, <IN> private inputs, <JOB> private job folder.

What is real: the two Command lines, read from the job files with their placeholders filled in; the p1536 tokenizer and
KE2 byte table; 45 documents of held-out v1 (3 per slice); Team 5's trainer, KAS V2 head, a Team 7 store.
What is a stand-in: a 2-layer, width-256 model trained 3 steps on synthetic text (run id dryrun2-1234); its delivered
manifest.json and summary.json were edited locally to smoke=false, AGREED_BASELINE_RUN and COMPLETED so that
--origin g5_delivery loads it; synthetic SFT pack shards and code tasks; --no-pack-check; small sizes appended to each
command; --device cpu; the RL reward replaced by a seeded coin (--stand-in-reward 0.4); MADE-UP benchmark rows.
Nothing here is a quality result. Not covered: GPU and bf16, the pinned data, the dry run 2 checkpoint, Team 9's scorer.

